# Through the Quicksand Caves: the status requirement. At status 1 SC_Entrance says NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY
# (7255, the battlefield framework's refusal); at status 0 it opens the menu (32000, bit 1).
lists ChamberOfOracles/SC_Entrance/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/SC_Entrance/onTrade ChamberOfOracles/onEventUpdate/32000 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32000 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32001 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32002 ChamberOfOracles/Shimmering_Circle/onTrigger
char zone=ChamberOfOracles pos=-218.6,-1.9,23.0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart ThroughTheQuicksandCaves current
login
missionstatus Zilart 1
trigger SC_Entrance                     # status 1: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY
missionstatus Zilart 0
trigger SC_Entrance                     # status 0: the menu
finish
